{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHG4JRPCA8YQMT902HVD","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHG42HZ9RMQEV9C703CJ","name_zh":"滅火術","name_en":"Quench","alphabet":"Q","source_access":{"kind":"basic","sources":[],"explicit_sources":[],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":[],"default_character_creation":true},"levels":[{"class":"德魯伊","level":3,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 3","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"言語，姿勢，法器","casting_time":"1 個標準動作","range":"中距（100 英尺+10 英尺/每等級） 區域或目標：每等級一個邊長 20 英尺的立方體（可變）或一個火系魔法物品","target":"","area":"","effect":"","duration":"立即","saving_throw":"無貨意志通過則無效（物品）","spell_resistance":"不可或可（物品）","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"滅火術通常用於撲滅森林火災和其他火災。它會熄滅區域內所有非魔法火焰。這個法術 同\n時也會解除掉區域內的所有火焰法術，只是你需要做一個解除檢定（1d20+1 每施法者等級，\n最多+15）來對抗每個法術以便解除它。解除此類法術的 DC 是 11+該火焰法術的施法者等級。\n滅火術區域內的所有元素（火）生物都會受到每施法者等級 1d6 的傷害（最多 15d6，\n無豁免）。\n作為替代用法，你可以將此法術單獨作用于一件用來創造或控制火焰的魔法物品。這個物\n品會失去所有火系魔法能力 1d4 小時，除非它成功通過了意志豁免。（神器對這個效果免\n疫。）","description_en":null,"source_pages":[835,835],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"587da18d3d7ddb3ea571b5e6eb541f6b4d8f19a5c53eac57a0b8ee0994b2c340","heading":"滅火術（Quench）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHG4PH7CFQGXM8ADTKKE","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHG48QHPPBRM532WPJZC","name_zh":"齊步行進","name_en":"Quick March","alphabet":"Q","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"牧師","level":2,"note":""},{"class":"聖武士","level":2,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"牧師 2，聖武士 2","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V，S，DF","casting_time":"1 快捷動作","range":"中距（100 尺+10 尺/等級）","target":"20 尺半徑爆發內的盟友","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 輪","saving_throw":"意志過則無效（無害）","spell_resistance":"可（無害）","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"在該法術的作用下，你和你的盟友的腳下升起一道黃色的靈光。\n齊步行進提升你的盟友的基礎陸地速度 30 尺。（該調整視為增強加值。）該加值對其他\n模式的移動方式無效，例如掘穴，攀爬，飛行或游泳。和其他提升生物速度的效果一樣，該法\n術也影響最遠跳躍距離。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[835,835],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"3ef62fe2382ca562de370b09cda1b025618ae86b39876e7c48628de4be3edc7c","heading":"齊步行進（Quick March）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHG46CHTQREBD3XPC0CB","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHG4VB0W7G8TQRW1ADCF","name_zh":"快速藥劑","name_en":"Quick Potion","alphabet":"Q","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"術士/法師","level":2,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"術士/法師 2","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V，S","casting_time":"1 分鐘","range":"碰觸","target":"碰觸到的裝滿水的燒瓶","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 小時/等級","saving_throw":"意志過則無效（物體）","spell_resistance":"可（物體）","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你低語完法術的最後的咒語然後用手指搖晃燒瓶。古銅色的火花從你的指尖滴落並讓水\n中充滿深深的鐵銹色。當火花完全溶解時，你開始施放你的下一個法術。\n你轉變燒瓶中的水以使其可以能夠向藥水的製作原理一樣儲存法術。在你的下一輪，你\n或者另一個施法者可以將法術施放到水中，使得瓶子中的水轉變為合適類型的藥劑。只有適\n合用來做藥水的法術可以以此方法使用。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[835,836],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"658e6fc91aea8dc4c35b1ce0e190f3f78101eb4193328251bc0c2aa588d9e699","heading":"快速藥劑（Quick Potion）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
