{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHG4ME6DCG4A09JQZX2C","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHG43YHNJK33MFS71CMZ","name_zh":"快速游泳","name_en":"Quickswim","alphabet":"Q","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["風暴之書"],"explicit_sources":["風暴之書"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["風暴之書"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"吟游詩人","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"巡林客","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"德魯伊","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"水族領域","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":1,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"吟游詩人 1，德魯伊 1，巡林客 1，水族領域 1，術士/法師 1","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V, S, M/DF","casting_time":"標準動作","range":"個人","target":"你","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 小時/等級（可解消）","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"這個法術能夠將你的基本游泳速度增加 10ft.；這個調整 屬於增強加值。法術對正在使\n用另一種移動方式的生物不起作用，例如陸上速度，掘穴，攀爬或是飛行。如果你沒有游泳\n速度，則無法從這一法術獲益。\n奧術施法材料：一片魚鱗。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[836,836],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"c71eb81b99688747a273b2b0b208a2c1c25cc5afb23bc37cbd20dc9e52f26c6e","heading":"快速游泳（Quickswim）（風暴之書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHG5EV94QKESNFC6T9HV","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHG59PPHF3QV0061M81D","name_zh":"針刺爆發","name_en":"Quill Blast","alphabet":"Q","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"德魯伊","level":5,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 5","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"咒法（創造）","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V，S，M","casting_time":"1 標準動作","range":"20 尺","target":"","area":"以你為中心 20 尺半徑擴散","effect":"","duration":"立即","saving_throw":"反射過則減半；見介紹","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"當你開始施放該法術時鋒利的針刺從你的皮膚上顯露出來，然後在你完成法術時飛向四\n面八方。\n在針刺爆發範圍內的生物根據他們的體型受到一或更多不同數目針刺的攻擊：超小型或\n更小，4 根；小型，6 根；中型，8 根；大型，10 根；超大型或更大，12 根。\n小型或更大的生物豁免攻擊成功將減半受到的針刺數；超小型或更小的生物豁免成功將\n完全躲避掉所有的針刺。\n每個針刺造成 1d6 點傷害並會刺入被它擊中的生物。刺入的針刺將導致一個非累積的\n攻擊檢定，豁免和檢定的-1 減值。以一個 DC 20 的醫療檢定所有針刺將被以一個標準動作\n安全的移除。否則，移除針刺將造成額外的 1d6 點傷害。\n施法材料：一根豪豬的刺。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[836,837],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"f7389a9a3f9659f08f110e0c16bdb4658cdff5be0f91c49085f1a2d1c549b0fb","heading":"針刺爆發（Quill Blast）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHG57D5VFG2NA7PPRWJP","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHG5C53V4N5X395SB92E","name_zh":"毒刺術","name_en":"Quillfire","alphabet":"Q","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"德魯伊","level":3,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 3","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V，S","casting_time":"1 標準動作","range":"個人","target":"你自己","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 輪/等級","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你呼喚自然的力量，你的手背佈滿長出的尖銳針刺。\n你的手上長出可以用於近戰或遠端攻擊的有毒尖刺。\n針刺造成 1d8 點傷害。它們可被用來投擲（射程增量 10 尺）。針刺有毒（傷口 DC 等於\n毒刺術的 DC，1d6 力量/1d6 力量）。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[837,838],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"bbd403ee847d53adf7b780f406e78d9fb7b48a8f5d75b4b5f999d37706cef6e2","heading":"毒刺術（Quillfire）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
